  "id": "brunch-spinach-salad",
  "name": "Brunch Spinach Salad",
  "subtitle": "A colorful spinach salad with fruit, cranberries, pine nuts, and poppy seed dressing.",
  "description": "Combine tender greens with sliced fruit, dried cranberries, and pine nuts, then toss with dressing just before serving.",
